    "file": "docs/operations/android-notifications.md",
    "line": "1. Create a Firebase project and register each Android application identifier you intend to build: `com.t3tools.t3code.dev`, `com.t3tools.t3code.preview`, or `com.t3tools.t3code`."
  },
  {
    "file": "docs/operations/android-notifications.md",
    "line": "Building with `APP_VARIANT=production` selects `com.t3tools.t3code` and its corresponding Clerk callback. Set the same variant during prebuild and bundling, and supply a Google services file that includes that package. Keep OTA updates disabled for a private binary. A locally signed build with this package cannot update an official installation signed by the maintainer or coexist with it; removing that installation also removes its app-local data. The development package remains a separate app."
  },
